 {name:'The library beneath the lake',setup:'A book returns itself to the shelf every time someone reads page 47. The librarian looks worried.',opts:[['Read page 47 aloud','A hidden stairway appears behind the dictionaries.','The floor fills with bubbles. Every book starts criticizing your accent.'],['Protect the librarian','Your party saves the library as water pours in through the windows.','You accidentally lock everyone in the map room overnight.'],['Search the flooded archive','You recover the lost town charter with one minute to spare.','You fish out a barrel of soggy, very angry magical scrolls.']]}
